分析対象外です（今夜の厳選・出尽くしサイン・レーティング変化・注目開示などの注目銘柄のみ、毎晩の実行で場中の5分足を取得して分析します）。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 'all')\">全期間(17年)</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"21.4\" width=\"320\" height=\"23.1\" fill=\"#c62f2f\" opacity=\"0.12\"/><polyline points=\"4.0,67.2 9.1,67.7 14.2,83.7 19.3,84.4 24.5,85.3 29.6,83.3 34.7,94.6 39.8,97.2 44.9,96.1 50.0,94.9 55.1,91.5 60.3,74.3 65.4,89.0 70.5,83.1 75.6,76.8 80.7,73.3 85.8,71.2 91.0,72.0 96.1,65.5 101.2,69.1 106.3,67.0 111.4,81.6 116.5,70.6 121.6,68.6 126.8,71.2 131.9,76.3 137.0,58.1 142.1,69.8 147.2,68.5 152.3,72.8 157.4,77.7 162.6,76.4 167.7,58.4 172.8,54.9 177.9,61.3 183.0,68.1 188.1,85.4 193.2,88.1 198.4,87.1 203.5,54.2 208.6,72.0 213.7,85.1 218.8,84.4 223.9,72.8 229.0,79.9 234.2,84.1 239.3,74.7 244.4,61.8 249.5,50.5 254.6,41.5 259.7,41.3 264.9,35.9 270.0,38.8 275.1,55.5 280.2,37.9 285.3,28.5 290.4,17.8 295.5,15.4 300.7,23.6 305.8,31.4 310.9,19.8 316.0,12.8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 79.2 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 79.2 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 79.2 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 79.2 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><circle cx=\"316.0\" cy=\"12.8\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#1c1c1e\"/></svg></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"3\" style=\"display:\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fff